<title>PHILIPPINES: Petron says weak peso will not hurt income.</title>
<headline>Petron says weak peso will not hurt income.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petron Corp said on Wednesday the declining peso will not hurt its bottomline this year.</p>
<p>&quot;The risk is minimal. We do not foresee a significant impact on our bottomline for the year,&quot; Petron Corp president Ali Al-Ajmi told reporters</p>
<p>&quot;We have prepared ourselves for this depreciation through our arbitrage income,&quot; said Monico Jacob, chairman of Petron.</p>
</text>
